{{ define "terms" }}
  {{ template "layout_header" . }}

  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-10 px-4 space-y-6">
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <p class="mt-kicker">Terms</p>
      <h1 class="mt-title">Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="mt-copy">These terms are intentionally short and limited to the project as it exists today.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-panel p-5 sm:p-6 space-y-5 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-6">
      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-100">Project status</h2>
        <p>Mana Tomb is a free, non-commercial hobby project for Magic: The Gathering players.</p>
        <p>The app may change, break, or go offline without notice while development continues.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-100">Accounts and public decks</h2>
        <p>You are responsible for the deck names, descriptions, and other content you choose to save or publish.</p>
        <p>If you publish a deck, treat it as public information until you make it private again or remove it.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-100">Card data and intellectual property</h2>
        <p>Mana Tomb uses card data and images provided through Scryfall.</p>
        <p>Card data is credited to Scryfall, and card images remain the property of Wizards of the Coast. The project should remain free and non-commercial.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-100">No warranty</h2>
        <p>Mana Tomb is provided as-is. Deck suggestions, card information, search results, and gameplay tools may be incomplete or inaccurate.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-100">Support</h2>
        <p>Feedback and bug reports currently go through the project&apos;s <a href="{{ projectIssuesURL }}" class="text-sky-300 hover:text-sky-200" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub issue tracker</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>

  {{ template "layout_footer" . }}
{{ end }}
